-- title:
--   Twentyseven-branch Syracuse descent remaining after a 58040-class refinement modulo $2^{27}$
-- statement:
--   Let $T(n)$ be the odd part of $3n+1$, and $T^t$ its $t$-fold iterate. Suppose $n$ satisfies every congruence and exclusion hypothesis of the [twentyseven-branch residual after the modulus-$2^{26}$ refinement](https://prove2.me/theorems/be7d88ec-edf6-4cd4-aef7-5196be4d9650), repeated verbatim in the formal statement. In particular $n\equiv 27\pmod{32}$, and $n$ avoids the explicit residue lists of the proved uniform descent theorems of this branch at moduli up to $2^{24}$, together with the nine chunk lists at $2^{26}$. Let $R_1,\dots,R_{24}$ be the 24 published list definitions `syrStep17Chunk1`–`syrStep17Chunk24` of the modulus-$2^{27}$ refinement, and add the conditions
--
--   $$
--   n\bmod 134217728\notin R_1,\quad \dots,\quad n\bmod 134217728\notin R_{24}.
--   $$
--
--   The remaining open assertion is
--
--   $$
--   \exists\, t\in\mathbb{N},\qquad T^{t}(n)<n.
--   $$
--
--   **Role.** The refined residual's hypotheses leave 184697 residue classes modulo $2^{26}$, i.e. 369394 classes modulo $2^{27}$. The 24 chunk lists consist of the 58040 of them certified by the published theorem [`CollatzFrontier.syracuse_terminal_budget_of_descent`](https://prove2.me/theorems/2513a4d3-77eb-4b93-9876-33755812122c) with exponent budget $27$; this child asks for descent on the complementary 311354 classes modulo $2^{27}$, with neither the starting value nor the descent time bounded. Parent, chunk theorems and this child are related by a case split on membership in the chunk lists. The statement is an explicitly unresolved child, not a claim that the parent or the Collatz conjecture is solved.
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The map is the existing `syracuseStep`. All inherited hypotheses keep the parent's names, order and literals; the 24 new hypotheses `he1`–`he24` are nonmemberships in the 24 published list definitions, so that the statement stays bounded in size instead of inlining another 58040 residues.
